  "description": "Auto-télémétrie mémoire du process daly-bms-server — RSS kernel vs statistiques allocateur jemalloc (investigation fuite RSS, docs/diagnostic-depannage.md §17). Diagnostic : si jemalloc allocated croît linéairement, la fuite est applicative (objets Rust retenus) ; si allocated reste plat alors que resident/RSS montent, c'est de la rétention/fragmentation allocateur.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "RSS vs jemalloc — la courbe qui tranche",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mémoire process — RSS / resident / active / allocated",
      "description": "allocated = octets vivants alloués par le code Rust. Une pente linéaire ici = vraie fuite applicative. RSS qui monte avec allocated plat = rétention allocateur (tuning decay jemalloc, pas chasse au leak).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "daly-metrics" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "daly-metrics" },
          "expr": "process_rss_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "RSS (kernel)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "daly-metrics" },
          "expr": "process_jemalloc_resident_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "jemalloc resident",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "daly-metrics" },
          "expr": "process_jemalloc_active_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "jemalloc active",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "daly-metrics" },
          "expr": "process_jemalloc_allocated_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "jemalloc allocated (heap Rust vivant)",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
